            call SetTalentDescription(heroId,index,"每隔|cff20c0008|r秒，你就可以在施法时移除|cff20c0001|r个对自身不利的效果，并治疗|cff20c0005%%|r的生命和法力；\n\n施放|cffffcc00附魔战刃|r可以使这个效果变为驱散目标敌人的|cff20c0001|r个增益效果，并造成|cffffcc00法术强度×1.5|r的法术伤害(奥术)\n\n总是能驱散目标敌方召唤物，且不进入冷却")

            set index = 9
            call SetTalentArt(heroId,index,false,"ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtonsDisabled\\DISBTNFeedBack.blp")
            call SetTalentArt(heroId,index,true,"ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtons\\BTNFeedBack.blp")
            call SetTalentName(heroId,index,"法力裂解")
            call SetTalentDescription(heroId,index,"施放|cffffcc00近卫|r会将攻击投射物替换为|cffffcc00附魔战刃|r；\n\n|cffffcc00附魔战刃|r在击中敌人时，燃烧你当前|cff20c00010%%|r的法力，并附加双倍伤害；\n\n激活法力护盾或学习了棱光护盾时，改为燃烧你当前|cff20c0005%%|r的生命，并恢复等量的法力")
            
            set index = 10
            call SetTalentArt(heroId,index,false,"ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtonsDisabled\\DISBTNDispelMagic.blp")
            call SetTalentArt(heroId,index,true,"ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtons\\BTNDispelMagic.blp")
            call SetTalentName(heroId,index,"奥法之触")
            call SetTalentDescription(heroId,index,"击中敌人时为其叠加奥法之触，持续|cff20c0006|r秒，至多叠加|cff20c0006|r层；\n\n敌人每拥有一层奥法之触，你就能忽略其|cff20c00010%%|r[x]的抗性；\n\n效果消失时，每层效果使你对其发射|cff20c0001|r枚奥术飞弹；\n\n每颗奥术飞弹造成|cffffcc00法术强度×0.5|r的法术伤害(奥术)；\n\n激活法力护盾或学习了棱光护盾时，奥术飞弹造成的伤害降低|cffff000050%%|r[x]，但在击中时为你恢复|cff20c0001%%|r的法力")
            
            set index = 11
            call SetTalentArt(heroId,index,false,"ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtonsDisabled\\DISbtnarcaneblast.blp")
            call SetTalentArt(heroId,index,true,"replaceabletextures\\commandbuttons\\mage_ability\\btnarcaneblast.blp")
            call SetTalentName(heroId,index,"奥术回响")
            call SetTalentDescription(heroId,index,"张开一个笼罩敌人的光环，它们受到的任何直接伤害都有|cff20c00025%%|r几率回响一次，产生|cff20c00050%%|r[x]的效果，视为法术伤害(奥术)")
            
